														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844349">
									

<p>Of the new stuff you've added, I have to say that the end of the new interview might be the most compelling part. At its core, the emotionally compelling elements here are centered around SCPxx's struggle to communicate what it perceives as a terrifying threat. The actual threat may or may not exist, but the truly evocative lines in this come from SCPxx's frustration and desperation. I'd recommend leaning into that.</p>
<p>I'd also like to echo my previous recommendation to reconsider some of your redactions. As discussed in <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607931909" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span>' <a href="http://scpwiki.com/avoid-the-blackbox" target="_blank">exceptional guide on the subject</a>, the style you're utilizing here isn't the best way to communicate your plot.</p>

							</div>

								
					
