<p>(First SCP) I believe that recently SCPs are too extreme and grandiose so here's a good old fashioned non world ending anomalous object</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>My idea is what appears to be a Infrared Temperature Gun ya know the kind with a laser pointer so it can help you aim at objects better (or mess with cats and dogs) and you point it at an object and it shows the temperature, now this one isn't like that instead it lists the melting point of the object it's aimed at and that object will proceed to heat to the temperature and melt, this does not effect objects that are liquid or objects that don't melt but do burn like wood (yes wood physically can't melt). I can think of many ways to build off of this. 682 test log perhaps? Maybe an interview of who the Foundation obtained it from? Anyway if y'all have any feedback, criticisms, or ideas for me please share them, I am open to suggestions.</p>

