			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844304">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Horror</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>A delve into Reality Anchor Construction and Design</li>
<li>An Thamiel anomalous SRA Component with strict rules about thinking about; the colour red, wives, or the fear of blood.</li>
<li>Additional component used in SRAs being lobotomized reality benders from Project Ichabod</li>
<li>Robert Scranton implicated to be the source of this blood.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The History of the blood being used in SRAs as a Hume lowering component in addition to an advanced state of the blood with hostile telepathic properties. Going onto unravelling the source of the fluid by a researcher and going rogue sending a drone into the origin dimension. Causes a large amount of blood to be converted into the hostile counterpart. Researcher has a tell-all interview with a member of O5 revealing what and who is the source of the blood. Still image of the drone footage is shown and the blood's conversion is happening spontaneously now and will convert all amounts by 20&#8212;. O5 Command reclassifying the blood to Keter is pending.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention Grabber:</strong> The idea that what if Robert Scranton was the source of this SRA component, the excess humes painfully funneling into the non-dimension, changing the doctor. Turning him into a weak god in the darkness of the abyss, feeding on other gods and becoming hateful of existence itself. Basically what if the Scarlet King is a forgotten echo of a man forced to live and become a god, losing all but his attention on his wife, and waiting to break back into our reality to make existence itself suffer.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Idea comes from the striking similarities of the beginning of Dust and Blood and the ending of 3001, both barely human entities stuck outside of reality, unable to die, cursed to exist only in red, with their only concern being their wives.</p>

